# The sites outside we_write.c that open a file for writing, drop the result
# of a save, compare one with numbers, or spell the old message.  Checked by
# tests/check-write-owner.sh.
#
#   file|rN:function|count|pass|reason
#
# rN is the rule (1 symbols, 2 opens, 4 dropped results, 5 numbers, 6 the old
# message); for rule 1 the file is the object and the function the symbol.
# "count" may only fall, and a line that matches nothing is stale.  "pass" is
# the pass that moves the site onto the owner and deletes the line; "keep" is
# a permanent exception and the reason says why the text is not the user's.

# the next passes of the owner
we_edit.o|r1:e_write|1|P2|autosave writes through e_write until wpe_write_copy
we_unix.o|r1:e_write|1|P2|the emergency save writes through e_write until wpe_write_copy
we_edit.c|r4:e_autosave|1|P2|the autosave drops the outcome until it becomes a copy
we_unix.c|r5:e_err_save_window|1|P2|the emergency save compares e_write with WPE_ESC until wpe_write_copy
we_prog.c|r4:e_chk_save_if_open|1|P3|a build save
we_prog.c|r4:e_comp_start|1|P3|a build save
we_prog.c|r4:e_exec_make|1|P3|a build save
we_prog.c|r4:e_prj_save_file|1|P3|a build save
we_prog.c|r4:e_run_sh|1|P3|a build save
we_prog.c|r2:e_write_default_prj|1|P1b|the new .prj, a stream write
we_prog.c|r2:e_wrt_prj_fl|1|P1b|the project file, a stream write
we_opt.c|r2:e_save_opt|1|P1b|the options file, a stream write
we_opt.c|r2:e_opt_lines_store|1|P1b|the options lines, a stream write
we_ai_path.c|r2:wpe_path_open_write|1|P4|the judged write into the user's own file
we_ai_ui.c|r2:ai_transcript_write|1|P4|the transcript
we_ai_ws.c|r2:ws_write_file|1|P4|the workspace's copies
we_ai_ws.c|r2:ws_write_pathspec|1|P4|the conversation
we_fl_unix.c|r2:WpeCopyFileCont|1|P5|the File Manager's Copy and its Move across file systems: both closes unjudged, the source removed after; a pass of its own

# not the user's text
we_prog.c|r6:e_prj_say_open_failed|2|keep|formats the message for the reads of the project machine
we_main.c|r6:e_msg|1|keep|the message table: the entry stays for e_prj_say_open_failed
we_ai.c|r2:wpe_ai_trace|1|keep|a behaviour trace
