we_ai_ui.c|r2:ai_consent_remember|1|keep|the consent marker
we_child.c|r2:wpe_child_io_tty|1|keep|a child's terminal
we_child.c|r2:wpe_child_stdout_to_file|1|keep|a child's output file
we_debug.c|r2:e_d_script_connect|2|keep|the debugger's own pty and pipe
we_debug.c|r2:e_d_script_write|1|keep|the script handed to the debugger
we_debug.c|r2:e_lsp_ui_hover|1|keep|a test trace
we_debug.c|r2:e_lsp_ui_trace|1|keep|a test trace
we_edit.c|r2:wpe_buffer_trace|1|keep|a behaviour trace
we_fl_unix.c|r2:e_man_run|1|keep|the temporary output of the man command
we_lsp.c|r2:lsp_trace_file|1|keep|a trace
we_main.c|r2:e_copy_file|1|keep|the XDG migration copy
